    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67c0b09a05a90dfd0d5256b2</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67c0b09a05a90dfd0d5256b2</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 28 Feb 2025 11:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本集内容 Brian 和 Harrison 将对新赛季 MLB 个人奖项进行预测，包括：赛季MVP、赛扬奖、最佳新秀、最佳教练、以及两位主持人认为的东山再起球员。两位主持人将在节目中分享个人的预测及观点。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="54">00:00:54</a> Brian 科普美职棒大联盟 MVP 奖的历史</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="379">00:06:19</a> 国联 MVP 预测：<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="381">00:06:21</a> 大谷翔平，<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="656">00:10:56</a> Juan Soto（胡安·索托）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1108">00:18:28</a> 美联 MVP 预测：<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1119">00:18:39</a> Mike Trout（麦克·特劳特），<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1414">00:23:34</a> Corey Seager（科里·西格）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1680">00:28:00</a> 国联赛扬奖预测：<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1682">00:28:02</a> Paul Skenes（保罗·斯金斯），<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1991">00:33:11</a> Zack Wheeler（扎克·惠勒）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2253">00:37:33</a> 美联赛扬奖预测：<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2255">00:37:35</a> Garrett Crochet（加雷特·克罗歇），<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2393">00:39:53</a> Cole Ragans（科尔·雷根斯）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2596">00:43:16</a> 最佳新秀预测：国联：Matt Shaw，Dylan Crews；美联：Jason Dominguez，Jackson Jobe</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3123">00:52:03</a> 最佳教练预测：国联：Terry Francona，Craig Counsell；美联：Mark Kotsay，AJ Hinch</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3715">01:01:55</a> 东山再起球员 Brian：Mike Trout，Ryan Pressly，Sandy Alcantara</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3948">01:05:48</a> 东山再起球员 Harrison：Corey Seager，Cody Bellinger，Sonny Gray</span></p>]]></description>
